=== COMPILE PL0 ===
  0 PROGRAM EX01; 
  0 VAR A; 
  1 BEGIN 
  2   READ(A); 
  4   IF A>10  THEN A:=10 
  9   ELSE A:=4; 
 13   A:=A+2*3; 
 19   WRITE(A) 
 21 END. 
  0 JMP 0 1
